# Agadeem's Awakening: "Return from your graveyard to the battlefield any number of target creature cards that each have a
# different mana value X or less." Wheel of Fortune puts Ornithopter (0), Glistener Elf (1), Benalish Hero (1), Mesa Pegasus (2) and Hired
# Blade (3) in Bot1's graveyard and Healer's Hawk (1) in Bot2's. With X = 1 the Ornithopter and one of the mana value 1 cards are
# accepted (the limit is inclusive); a second mana value 1 card (CR 202.3), the Pegasus just past the limit, and the opponent's
# Hawk (not "from your graveyard", CR 115.1) and the Black Lotus (mana value 0, but not a creature card) are each refused;
# the unchosen cards stay where they are.
# The cost {1}{B}{B}{B} is paid by exactly four sources.

